    "rating": 4.3,
    "reference": "ChIJr3pnLTE2yUwRmqtJzU2jE2w",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Alex C",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103572888720474910913/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_OR3rkeX527kN2EslZba2mGa04ZL2d2CSoz6gsOpFSTwviA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "This was our first time visiting this store with my family, and it certainly won’t be our last. I was looking for a set of suit, and Christina greeted us and asked about the occasion. She helped me select the right suit and offered excellent advice on how to coordinate everything. She also patiently assisted my daughter’s boyfriend with selecting several shirts and pants to try on. Christina took great care of us and made sure everything met our expectations. She provided truly exceptional service.",
        "time": 1767018689,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rasha Abdel-Majeed",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117251795187720779227/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI5sZlqHt5nyZBqmll9jr4V42s8eXqg1HrmviWVNvWijfL4WA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "My first time entering Moore’s was to find quality gifts for my husband’s Christmas presents. Prior to this visit, my husband and his wedding party had rented suits for the day 18 years ago and no business since then. My impression was the store catered to formal attire and “older” gentleman clothing. It was an unstudied act on a whim but I am a confirmed repeat customer. Not only was I greeted upon entry with a smile but was given VIP service. The staff were courteous and attentive and Christina had lifted this experience for me by cinching black leather jacket and a pair of shoes! Then we came back again shortly after with my husband who has now converted to a Moore’s client (previously Banana Republic walking poster boy), leaving the store with a few more goodies in tow. We are so taken by the exquisite attention to detail (hearing the client working with objections and preferences), presenting options -colours, trends, alternatives-, patience and providing first class customer care ordering in models and items not held in store and locating desired sizes! Christina has made us both feel like. I should have known she was the manager by the savvy and responsive way she made decisions to find workable solutions. A deal closer. Thank you, we will be buying from Vaudreuil store even though it is out of our way and there are other stores closer to our home. We definitely wish to shop with Christina at the helm! Well-done!",
        "time": 1767917852,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Don Morris",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114850596418115485333/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5wETdZ5XCn9oXSvNmPuIFtK9d4iECR6wGPJF2aDho8pyHdk1r=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Had to pickup a shirt and tie for an upcoming event. This is the second time that Christina has helped me with purchases. The first time I had left things to the last minute. This location didn’t have the item in stock but she found the only one available at another store and had it rushed over. Great service!! This time again I needed it in a hurry and she asked if we would like to have the shirt ironed to save time.\nThis is what great customer service is all about.\nWould highly recommend this store.\nThank you so much Christina.",
        "time": 1764695356,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Diana Ford",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116221915762290602668/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKq5_OSbfvx5dJVoyavXPWtvdRSlb_9n_96Ah0iZDwHhGrc7Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
